Source: National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, Central Files,
                    1967-69, POL 33 PERSIAN GULF. Secret; Immediate;
                        Exdis. Drafted by Eliot on January 31; cleared by Brewer and Saunders, and in draft by Battle and Katzenbach;
                    and approved by Rockwell. Repeated to
                    Dhahran for Ambassador Eilts, and to
                    Jidda, Kuwait, and New Delhi for Rostow.
